{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57587","headline":"太帝君赞大有妙经颂一章 · 无名氏","name":"太帝君赞大有妙经颂一章","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"翳翳元化初，眇眇晨霞散。\n太寂空玄上，寥朗二仪判。\n凝精抱空胎，结化孕灵观。\n含真颐神内，倏歘啓㝠旦。\n始悟忧促龄，运交反天汉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57587.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57587","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}